  "definition": "Revocation",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-06-28",
  "historyNote": "#9319-B, eff 11-12-08, EXPIRED: 11-12-16 New. #12099, INTERIM, eff 2-2-17, EXPIRES: 8-1-17; ss by #12225-B, eff 6-28-17",
